<title>USA: Trans World sees profitable year.</title>
<headline>Trans World sees profitable year.</headline>
<dateline>ALBANY, N.Y. 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trans World Entertainment Corp said Monday it expects a good fourth quarter and being profitable for the year.</p>
<p>The company said it views 1997 with optimism and further improvement in its operating results.</p>
</text>
